<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WORLD SERIES TOURNAMENT STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WORLD SERIES TOURNAMENT STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE, Australia 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings in the</p>
<p>World Series triangular limited-overs cricket tournament on</p>
<p>Sunday (tabulate under played, won, lost, points).</p>
<p>    Australia     3    2     1	 4</p>
<p>    Pakistan	1    1     0	 2</p>
<p>    West Indies   2    0     2	 0</p>
